Eitri OS: third-party material specific to the image
(see also the NOTICE file at the repository root, which lists the rest)

The image is built by Buildroot, which records the exact licences and sources of
every package in it: run "make -C os legal-info".

Items that are not obvious from the defconfig:

linux-firmware (Wi-Fi: rtl8710bu / rtl8xxxu blobs)
  Redistributable firmware under the licences in the linux-firmware tree.
  Only the files for the adapters the board uses are installed.

Rockchip rkbin DDR blob (optional)
  Proprietary. Only used when the image is configured with
  "make -C os ddrbin-config"; the default image uses U-Boot's open TPL and does
  not contain it. A build that includes it must not be redistributed unless
  Rockchip's terms allow it.

Trusted Firmware-A (BL31), U-Boot, Linux, RAUC, ustreamer, Katapult, Fluidd,
Mainsail, go2rtc (MIT), uv (Apache-2.0 OR MIT): see the root NOTICE.

Files in this directory tree are Apache-2.0 unless a file says otherwise;
kernel and U-Boot patches and fragments are GPL-2.0.
